      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（这是银河座独有的改编。/n　乔班尼，是被柯贝内拉拯救的）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080110",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「扎内利太过分了，总是马上说我的坏话。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 110,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "　可是柯贝内拉绝对不会说别人的坏话」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080121",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（乔班尼承受着许多痛苦。/n　对他而言，柯贝内拉的存在就是一种救赎）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080130",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（所以，我能理解他想救柯贝内拉的心情。/n　可自我牺牲，真的能称作幸福吗……？）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 110,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊啊啊！不行，想不明白！/n真正的幸福到底是什么啊！？",
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 207,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 2,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我国德国的哲学家叔本华曾说过。/n「如果你清点自己的幸福，就会立刻变得幸福。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "少给我讲大道理。而且哲学又不能换钱。",
      "BgmFileName": "203",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "别这么说，你不是在争取乔班尼吗。/n说不定我能帮上什么忙。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哼！不需要你帮忙。我自己来。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 110,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……话说回来，你打算争取哪个角色？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "扎内利。就是欺负你的那个角色。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080210",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈哈，那你连揣摩角色都省了吧？/n反正你平时就老爱来招惹我。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080220",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我并没有那个意思……。/n如果让你觉得是这样，我道歉。对不起……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这种时候不是应该笑着贯彻自己的作风吗。/n一点都不像扎内利……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080240",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 600,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你没听说其他人的动向吗？/n绯花里、芬兰，还有千寿历呢？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080250",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "没听说具体情况。最近也几乎没和她们说话。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080260",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "平时不插手别人的事就浑身难受的你/n居然没说话？发烧了？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080270",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 502,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "因为我感觉得到，大家都在认真对待这一次。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302080280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 2,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        },
        {
          "slotNumber": 2,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 4,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030208031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030208,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
